      "source": "<a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a> implementation that uses a <a href=\"../../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a> to obtain id type information and uses\na <a href=\"../../../mapping/IdentifierAccessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>IdentifierAccessor</code></a> to access the property value if requested.",
      "translation": "实现了<a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.repository.core 中的接口\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a>，它使用<a href=\"../../../mapping/PersistentEntity.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentEntity</code></a>获取 ID 类型信息，并在需要时使用<a href=\"../../../mapping/IdentifierAccessor.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>IdentifierAccessor</code></a>访问属性值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Useful base class to implement custom <a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a>s and delegate execution of standard methods from\n<a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a> to a special implementation.",
      "translation": "一个有用的基类，用于实现自定义的 <a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a>，并将 <a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a> 中标准方法的执行委托给特殊实现。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../EntityInformation.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>EntityInformation</code></a> for the given <a href=\"../RepositoryMetadata.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.repository.core\"><code>RepositoryMetadata</code></a>.",
